<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Paladin Skills</h1>
<p>The skills the Paladins' guild teaches, in its hall by the Midgaard Cathedral. Level is the guild level at which you can first practice the skill there, and Up to is the most you can learn it at the guild (see <a cmd='#'>Help Practice</a>).
</p>
<pre>Name                 Level   Up to
Armor Soft Leather       0   50%
Consider                 0   90%
Rescue                   0   100%
Shield                   0   100%
Diagnostics              1   70%
Bash                     3   80%
First Aid                3   50%
Turn Undead              5   70%
Armor Hard Leather       7   70%
Leadership              12   100%
Armor Chain             15   100%
Armor Plate             20   100%
</pre>
